{"id":"granja","lemma":"granja","pos":"noun","rank":1439,"glosses":["farm, grange","farm"],"ipa":"/ˈɡɾanxa/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"granjas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/76/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-granja.wav","examples":[{"text":"Trabajé en una granja.","en":"I worked on a farm.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/70228"},{"text":"Ellos vivían en granjas o en pequeñas poblaciones.","en":"They lived on farms or in small towns.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/693246"},{"text":"Esa granja pertenece a Tom.","en":"That farm belongs to Tom.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/301761"},{"text":"Pocas granjas tenían electricidad.","en":"Few farms had electricity."},{"text":"¿Qué crias en tu granja?","en":"What do you grow on your farm?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/806513"}]}